  "body": "More than just a home, this bespoke residence is a sanctuary — a place to connect, unwind, and become part of Long Bay’s vibrant coastal story. \r\n\r\nEvery detail has been carefully considered. From the selection of premium materials and quality appliances to the effortless flow of the living spaces, this home delivers luxury, functionality, and coastal elegance in perfect harmony. \r\n\r\nKey Features: \r\n• Four spacious bedrooms, including two generous master suites \r\n• Designer open-plan kitchen and expansive living areas \r\n• Panoramic sea views \r\n• High-end finishes, fixtures, and fittings throughout \r\n• Light-filled interiors with seamless indoor–outdoor flow \r\n\r\nThe location is unbeatable — just moments from pristine Long Bay Beach and scenic coastal walkways, and within zone for highly regarded Long Bay College, Long Bay School, and Northcross Intermediate. Opportunities of this calibre are rare. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing and start living the lifestyle you deserve.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
